EU foreign ministers are currently in Luxembourg for an urgent meeting 🇪🇺, aiming to strengthen migration control deals with North African nations. The talks involve more financial aid and better collaboration to reduce irregular crossings to Europe. Ministers will likely push for firmer commitments on search and rescue and asylum processing. The goal is to show a unified stance before the next European Council meeting on migration 🤝.
